# 6 October 2026 : BAND 4 (hairy stem) VERSION 3. Matthieu: the stem and the bud must be perfect, 64 nodes then optimisation, seamless. The v2 hairs were level curves of a flow coordinate, which draws regular arcs, not hairs. The right brick is STREAK BLUR WITH A DIRECTION FIELD: sparse seeds (a thresholded noise) are smeared along a per pixel direction (the hair angle, +55 degrees at the top of the cylinder, 0 in the middle, -55 at the bottom), so every seed becomes a short stroke that follows the cylinder, with its own length and its own place. No cell: all noises tile over the canvas and the blur wraps, so the band is seamless. FR : bande 4 version 3, tige poilue par flou directionnel.
